%% UC-08 — View recommendations & give feedback
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (recommendationsRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Open Recommendations
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/recommendations/me
    B->>M: find(recommendations, {userId: sub})
    M-->>B: recommendation records
    B-->>F: own recommendations
    P->>F: Write feedback on a recommendation
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/recommendations/:id/feedback {text}
    B->>M: insert(recommendation_feedback)
    B-->>F: 201 feedback stored
